meta {
  name: Logout
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ### Logout User
  Invalidates active refresh tokens and clears HTTP-only authentication cookies.

  **Authentication:** Reads `refresh_token` HTTP-only cookie or current user session.

  **Response:**
  - `200 OK`: Clears `access_token` and `refresh_token` cookies and logs `USER_LOGOUT` audit event.
}
